{
  "name": "Innate Sorcery",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An event in your past left an indelible mark on you, infusing you with simmering magic. As a Bonus Action, you can unleash that magic for 1 minute, during which you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>The spell save DC of your Sorcerer spells increases by 1.</li><li>You have Advantage on the Attack Rolls of Sorcerer spells you cast.</li></ul><p>You can use this feature twice, and you regain all expended uses of it when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
